The '''footprint''' was a joke item from [[Java Edition 20w14∞]], found only in the <code>missing</code> dimension.

== Appearance ==
The footprint is a semi-transparent item with a grey color scheme.

== Obtaining ==
This item cannot be found in the [[Creative inventory]], but it can be middle-click duplicated in Creative mode or given with the {{cmd|give <target> minecraft:footprint <amount>}} command.

=== Dimension ===
Footprints are only generated in a chest in the <code>missing</code> dimension. There is a maximum of 2 footprints that can be legitimately obtained in any world.

== Usage ==
This item cannot be placed or used in any way.

